<title>USA: Insituform names Kalishman chairman.</title>
<headline>Insituform names Kalishman chairman.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insituform Technologies Inc said on Monday it named Jerome Kalishman, the former vice chairman, to the position of chairman, succeeding James Krugman.</p>
<p>The company also said Anthony Hooper was elected president and chief executive. He succeeds Jean-Paul Richard who resigned to become president and chief executive of AGCO Corp.</p>
<p>Hooper most recently was the senior vice president of marketing and technology.</p>
</text>
